WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
If you have extra money after completing all your payments, how would you save it? Cash, bank, or gold?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Gold — I will buy gold because I can use it later.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Ah okay, so you have a habit of buying gold. Why is that? For emergency?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Yes, when I have an emergency I can use that gold to manage my expenses.
